{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25028","headline":"潇湘游 · 刘言史","name":"潇湘游","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夷女采山蕉，缉纱浸江水。\n野花满髻妆色新，闲歌[欸]乃深峡里。\n[欸]乃知从何处生，当时泣舜肠断声。\n翠华寂寞婵娟没，野筱空余红泪情。\n青烟冥冥覆杉桂，崖壁凌天风雨细。\n昔人幽恨此地遗，绿芳红艳含怨姿。\n清猨未尽鼯鼠切，泪水流到湘妃祠。\n北人莫作潇湘游，九疑云入苍梧愁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘言史","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25028.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25028","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}